('Stock bought in a private placement is restricted, which means the buyer:',
 'Cannot resell it freely', ['Has no voting rights', 'Receives no dividends', 'Must hold it for life'],
 'Restricted securities were not sold in a registered public offering, so resale is limited until an exemption such as SEC Rule 144 applies. Voting and dividend rights are unaffected.'),
